EN:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}You two sure took your time,
didn't you?! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}I thought you'd gone
off{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} and had a party without me!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ve la siete presa proprio comoda,
eh?! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Cioè, ho anche pensato che
foste andati a qualche festa trendy!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ihr zwei habt euch ja mal echt ganz
schön Zeit gelassen, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}hm?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ich dacht schon, ihr habt ohne mich
'ne Party geschmissen!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ama siz de bayağı ağırdan aldınız,
değil mi?! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Bensiz gidip{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} eğlenmeye
