FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}J'ai cru comprendre que t'avais
quelque chose d'urgent à me dire,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} ?
J'ai fait aussi vite que j'ai pu !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Sorry to drag you here so last
minute,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} but I {{TAG:0003:0025:}}wanted to return the
exercise equipment I borrowed!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}I know, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}I know—{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}I've had it for,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} like,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
a MILLION years. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}But I'm returning
it now, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}so let's call it even!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Je pense avoir trouvé un truc à toi
sur le quai de la gare...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Tu m'avais pas dit que tu l'utilisais
pour te muscler les doigts de pied ?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I want your expert advice!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I need to
pump up my arm muscles.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}} It isn't
easy carrying heavy shopping bags!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Necesito consejos para estar tan
en forma como tú!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}} ¡Ya ni puedo
cargar con las bolsas de la compra!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
