ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¿Te has olvidado de tu promesa? {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
